{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2448060205267927", "organization": {"id": "1682979888680853", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1758986534231171"}]}, "id": "2301046810128245"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1769556916445392"}]}, "id": "221530645283424"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "2448060205267927"}, {"id": "1304877726278670"}]}, "id": "1546487868739502"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "2448060205267927", "release_date": 1558459800, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 20}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "38200893979557763"}, "id": "703449633385683"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1787649084, "id": "38468707959443029", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v86", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 85, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "38468731986107293"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "2448060205267927"}, "id": "38468731986107293", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "2448060205267927", "is_first_party": true, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "762062031447636"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2308857129946677", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beat Saber", "keywords": ["m\u00fasica", "ritmo", "baile", "sable", "canci\u00f3n"], "long_description": "\u201cBeat Saber\u201d es un juego r\u00edtmico de RV \u00fanico donde tu meta es rebanar los ritmos (representados por peque\u00f1os cubos) a medida que se aproximan a ti. \n\nCada ritmo indica qu\u00e9 sable debes usar y tambi\u00e9n la direcci\u00f3n que debes seguir. Toda la m\u00fasica est\u00e1 compuesta para encajar perfectamente con los niveles cuidadosamente dise\u00f1ados. \n\nNuestra meta es hacer que los jugadores pr\u00e1cticamente bailen mientras cortan los cubos y evitan los obst\u00e1culos.\n\nCada corte viene bien acompa\u00f1ado de un gran sonido y efectos visuales para enfatizar el ritmo.\n\nMusic Downloads Not Rated by the ESRB \n\nVisit www.esrb.org for rating information \n\nMUSIC DOWNLOADS NOT RATED BY PEGI - www.pegi.info", "short_description": "\u201cBeat Saber\u201d es un juego r\u00edtmico de RV donde tu meta es rebanar los ritmos que coincidan perfectamente con la m\u00fasica cuidadosamente dise\u00f1ada."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2275094883263129", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beat Saber", "keywords": ["Musik", "Rhythmus", "Tanz", "Saber", "Song"], "long_description": "\u201eBeat Saber\u201c ist ein einzigartiges VR-Rhythmusspiel, in dem du die Beats (in Form kleiner W\u00fcrfel) triffst, w\u00e4hrend sie auf dich zukommen. \n\nJeder Beat gibt an, welchen S\u00e4bel du verwenden und in welche Richtung du schlagen musst. Die Musik wurde komplett von Hand ma\u00dfgeschneidert, um perfekt auf die von Hand erstellten Levels zu passen. \n\nUnser Ziel ist es, die Spieler geradezu zum Tanzen zu bringen, w\u00e4hrend sie die W\u00fcrfel zerschlagen und Hindernissen ausweichen.\n\nJeder Hieb wird durch tolle Sound- und visuelle Effekte untermalt, die den Rhythmus betonen.\n\nMusic Downloads Not Rated by the ESRB \n\nVisit www.esrb.org for rating information \n\nMUSIC DOWNLOADS NOT RATED BY PEGI - www.pegi.info", "short_description": "\u201eBeat Saber\u201c ist ein VR-Rhythmusspiel, in dem du die Beats triffst, die perfekt zu der von Hand ma\u00dfgeschneiderten Musik passen."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "beatsaber_fg.png", "id": "2106442563297242", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON_FOREGROUND", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_2106442566630575_8147482319493228998_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1DolPwYCey0Q7kNvwE2LHai&_nc_oc=AdpvCkOY5VSEYn6Awocp_CyfoAVMo0v8-3OAxXKBCKoaWMiM3_lgOLGRGFHI2jC8uSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI71AkXS83lfvAgitOhKHinzjXJVmzl3ZhArNMuwLjCyw&oe=6AA95E66"}, {"file_name": "Square.png", "id": "1761610854986121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1761610861652787_2878684960510284116_n.png?_nc_cat=1&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=71Cy6ZSsHvUQ7kNvwGYHc3-&_nc_oc=AdocLqd8r_8dWHAX-afRIbJpsfwvwn2BFbfrsyBExYbWds6RNT9TzcDuzeQWp2UsUJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJyXoxplNesr61muvy9I5z-IgN8CGtwUNwg_ZAzUD5zgg&oe=6AA94430"}, {"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "1706114010493934", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1706114017160600_9117714321231267776_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iXXJxhsM3gkQ7kNvwFEqAK6&_nc_oc=Adr5WoEsUijqYsJRSkFF-0VYU0bjT0czfj2zMiTvfxzoQVUW2F4sqi8gvZRVdAVJIR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIs8EGJajbdtFLGZsDBv2mh0tZNUKqbL2TuAX16IDAXag&oe=6AA95436"}, {"file_name": "HeroImage.png", "id": "1633787038305120", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_1633787044971786_3142764932326361374_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A0Cby22ZOfYQ7kNvwF9SsNO&_nc_oc=AdpV4DQoANolHwKe0LWI2QzbwsJetZjTJBOBGk7NNVT4de5Z83OVgOE